      "description": "Scope: irrigation:write. Create-only. Supply raw inputs for ONE calculation method (configured_flow | session_flow + flow_l_per_hour | total_volume + volume_l | meter_readings + meter_start_l/meter_end_l); VineTrack derives volume, per-block allocations, efficiency and vintage."
